irectly) conferred on him (perfect) knowledge,","roots_ordered":["علم","شدد","قوي"],"tokens_ordered":["علمه","شديد","القوي"],"vec_preview":[0.02590000070631504,0.05290000140666962,-0.005100000184029341,0.007300000172108412,0.043800000101327896,0.02759999968111515,0.0034000000450760126,-0.013000000268220901]},{"ayah_id":"53:6","surah":53,"ayah":6,"arabic":"ذُو مِرَّةٍ فَاسْتَوَىٰ","english":"He Who is absolute beauty. Then He (the Effulgence of Beauty) decided to unveil (Himself).","roots_ordered":["ذو","مرر","سوي"],"tokens_ordered":["ذو","مرة","فاستوي"],"vec_preview":[0.005499999970197678,0.00860000029206276,-0.013399999588727951,0.012600000016391277,0.020400000736117363,-0.0031999999191612005,-0.016699999570846558,-0.0052999998442828655]},{"ayah_id":"53:7","surah":53,"ayah":7,"arabic":"وَهُوَ بِالْأُفُقِ الْأَعْلَىٰ","english":"And he (Muhammad [blessings and peace be upon him]) was on the uppermost horizon (of the realm of creation during the Ascension Night i.e., on the apex of the created cosmos).","roots_ordered":["هو","افق","علو"],"tokens_ordered":["وهو","بالافق","الاعلي"],"vec_preview":[-0.019700000062584877,0.009700000286102295,-0.008500000461935997,0.030400000512599945,0.010400000028312206,-0.015699999406933784,-0.033399999141693115,-0.012500000186264515]},{"ayah_id":"53:8","surah":53,"ayah":8,"arabic":"ثُمَّ دَنَا فَتَدَلَّىٰ","english":"Then He (the Lord of Honour) drew closer (to His Beloved Muhammad [blessings and peace be upon him]) and then drew even closer.*","roots_ordered":["ثمم","دنو","دلو"],"tokens_ordered":["دنا","فتدلي"],"vec_preview":[-0.016300000250339508,0.02290000021457672,-0.011699999682605267,0.026799999177455902,0.018799999728798866,-0.013700000010430813,0.03020000085234642,0.005499999970197678]},{"ayah_id":"53:9","surah":53,"ayah":9,"arabic":"فَكَانَ قَابَ قَوْسَيْنِ أَوْ أَدْنَىٰ","english":"Then a distance measuring only two bow-lengths was left (between Allah Unveiled and His Esteemed Beloved), or even less than that (in extreme nearness).","roots_ordered":["كون","قوب","قوس","او","دنو"],"tokens_ordered":["فكان","قاب","قوسين","ادني"],"vec_preview":[-0.011099999770522118,0.02459999918937683,-0.01269999984651804,0.04170000180602074,-0.011900000274181366,-0.004699999932199717,0.01730000041425228,-0.016499999910593033]},{"ayah_id":"53:10","surah":53,"ayah":10,"arabic":"فَأَوْحَىٰ إِلَىٰ عَبْدِهِ مَا أَوْحَىٰ","english":"So (on that station of nearness) He (Allah) revealed to His (Beloved) servant whatever He revealed.","roots_ordered":["وحي","الي","عبد","ما"],"tokens_ordered":["فاوحي","عبده","اوحي"],"vec_preview":[-0.02930000051856041,0.01080000028014183,-0.006599999964237213,-0.0019000000320374966,9.999999747378752e-05,0.015300000086426735,0.0649000033736229,0.012199999764561653]},{"ayah_id":"53:11","surah":53,"ayah":11,"arabic":"مَا كَذَبَ الْفُؤَادُ مَا رَأَىٰ","english":"(His) heart did not take it contrary to what (his) eyes beheld.","roots_ordered":["ما","كذب","فاد","راي"],"tokens_ordered":["كذب","الفءاد","راي"],"vec_preview":[-0.012199999764561653,-0.017899999395012856,-0.007899999618530273,0.02199999988079071,-0.0020000000949949026,0.009399999864399433,0.04690000042319298,0.003599999938160181]},{"ayah_id":"53:12","surah":53,"ayah":12,"arabic":"أَفَتُمَارُونَهُ عَلَىٰ مَا يَرَىٰ","english":"Do you argue with him about what he saw?","roots_ordered":["مري","علي","ما","راي"],"tokens_ordered":["افتمارونه","يري"],"vec_preview":[-0.026799999177455902,0.009200000204145908,-0.010300000198185444,0.007400000002235174,-0.0015999999595806003,-0.000699999975040555,-0.029200000688433647,-0.009499999694526196]},{"ayah_id":"53:13","surah":53,"ayah":13,"arabic":"وَلَقَدْ رَآهُ نَزْلَةً أُخْرَىٰ","english":"And assuredly, he saw Him (Allah Unveiled) the second time (again and you argue only about seeing Him once).*","roots_ordered":["قد","راي","نزل","اخر"],"tokens_ordered":["ولقد","راه","نزلة","اخري"],"vec_preview":[-0.00019999999494757503,0.03220000118017197,-0.01140000019222498,0.013399999588727951,0.0008999