lth in the way of Allah) and (then) held back (his hand)?","roots_ordered":["عطو","قلل","كدي"],"tokens_ordered":["واعطي","قليلا","واكدي"],"vec_preview":[0.03350000083446503,0.020400000736117363,-0.011300000362098217,0.03819999843835831,0.016599999740719795,0.007400000002235174,-0.03370000049471855,-0.010499999858438969]},{"ayah_id":"53:35","surah":53,"ayah":35,"arabic":"أَعِندَهُ عِلْمُ الْغَيْبِ فَهُوَ يَرَىٰ","english":"Does he have the knowledge of the unseen that he can see?","roots_ordered":["عند","علم","غيب","هو","راي"],"tokens_ordered":["اعنده","علم","الغيب","فهو","يري"],"vec_preview":[0.027000000700354576,0.10540000349283218,-0.013000000268220901,0.03020000085234642,0.012900000438094139,0.009700000286102295,0.028200000524520874,-0.0024999999441206455]},{"ayah_id":"53:36","surah":53,"ayah":36,"arabic":"أَمْ لَمْ يُنَبَّأْ بِمَا فِي صُحُفِ مُوسَىٰ","english":"Has he not been given the knowledge of (matters) mentioned in the scriptures of Musa (Moses),","roots_ordered":["ام","لم","نبا","بما","في","صحف","موس"],"tokens_ordered":["ام","ينبا","بما","صحف","موسي"],"vec_preview":[-0.012600000016391277,0.002400000113993883,-0.0035000001080334187,-0.016599999740719795,-0.012299999594688416,0.029200000688433647,0.05790000036358833,0.017899999395012856]},{"ayah_id":"53:37","surah":53,"ayah":37,"arabic":"وَإِبْرَاهِيمَ الَّذِي وَفَّىٰ","english":"And in the (scriptures) of Ibrahim (Abraham), who accomplished (all the commands of Allah) with perfection?","roots_ordered":["ابر","اللذ","وفي"],"tokens_ordered":["وابراهيم","الذي","وفي"],"vec_preview":[-0.0038999998942017555,0.06700000166893005,-0.007300000172108412,0.012900000438094139,0.022199999541044235,-0.0031999999191612005,0.04340000078082085,0.00839999970048666]},{"ayah_id":"53:38","surah":53,"ayah":38,"arabic":"أَلَّا تَزِرُ وَازِرَةٌ وِزْرَ أُخْرَىٰ","english":"That no bearer of a burden will carry the burden of (the sins) of another;","roots_ordered":["اللا","وزر","اخر"],"tokens_ordered":["تزر","وازرة","وزر","اخري"],"